 * Auxiliary Constructions:
: Points


 * Proof steps:
001. CA = CB [00] & DA = DB [01] (SSS)⇒  ∠ACD = ∠DCB [04]
002. E,C,D are collinear [02] & ∠ACD = ∠DCB [04] ⇒  ∠ACE = ∠ECB [05]
